<title>USA: REEARCH ALERT - EVEREN ups United Dominion.</title>
<headline>REEARCH ALERT - EVEREN ups United Dominion.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- EVEREN said it said it raised its rating on United Dominion Realty Trust Inc to near-term buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- EVEREN kept its long-term rating as a buy.</p>
<p>-- United Dominion remained unchanged from its closing price on Tuesday of 15.</p>
</text>
